        {
            "id": "https://costalong.com/2026/03/12/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture/",
            "url": "https://costalong.com/2026/03/12/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture/",
            "title": "ClawHub 技术解密：AI Agent Skill 注册中心的架构实现",
            "date_published": "2026-03-12T04:00:00.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p>npm 之于 JavaScript、PyPI 之于 Python，OpenClaw 的 Skill 也需要一个发布和分发的地方，这就是 ClawHub。我把它 <code>b32a499</code> 版本的源码在本机跑起来后，有两点发现：没配 OpenAI Key 时，搜索只剩 slug 和名称的前缀匹配；静态安全扫描会把 SKILL.md 里要求 <code>curl | bash</code> 的写法判为 clean。下文对照仓库代码看它是怎么实现的。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>代码版本说明</strong><br>文中代码片段摘自 <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub\">openclaw/clawhub</a> 在 2026-03-12 的 main 分支（commit <code>b32a499</code>），为便于阅读做了删减。2026-10 复核时主干已经有不少变化，涉及的地方在正文里单独标注。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"893\" style=\"--img-ar:1.7917\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture_f8e1ed0fcec3.webp\" alt=\"ClawHub 技术架构全景图，展示 Convex 后端、TanStack Start 前端、向量搜索和 CLI 四大模块的连接关系，蓝紫色调科技风\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"ClawHub-是什么\"><a href=\"#ClawHub-是什么\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"ClawHub 是什么\"></a>ClawHub 是什么</h2><p>ClawHub 是 OpenClaw（早期名为 Clawdbot，项目和 CLI 也因此曾叫 ClawdHub / <code>clawdhub</code>）的公共 Skill 注册中心。它的核心职责是：让开发者能发布、版本化、搜索和安装 AI Agent 的 skill——本质上是一个 <code>SKILL.md</code> 加上配套文件的 bundle。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>项目概况</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>GitHub: <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub\">openclaw/clawhub</a>（写作时约 5.5k stars，截至 2026-10 约 9.5k）</li>\n<li>技术栈: TypeScript + Convex + TanStack Start + React 19</li>\n<li>许可证: MIT</li>\n<li>官网: <a href=\"https://clawhub.ai/\">clawhub.ai</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>和 npm 或 Homebrew 这类传统包管理器不同，ClawHub 分发的主要是文本形式的 Agent 指令，二进制和代码包只是少数。这决定了它的架构在搜索、安全审查和版本管理上做了很多针对性设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"技术栈全景\"><a href=\"#技术栈全景\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"技术栈全景\"></a>技术栈全景</h2><p>ClawHub 的技术选型可以概括为四层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前端</td>\n<td>TanStack Start + React 19 + Tailwind CSS 4</td>\n<td>SSR 渲染、路由、Skill 浏览 UI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后端</td>\n<td>Convex（实时数据库 + Serverless Functions）</td>\n<td>数据存储、业务逻辑、HTTP API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索</td>\n<td>OpenAI <code>text-embedding-3-small</code> + Convex 向量索引</td>\n<td>语义搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具链</td>\n<td>Bun + Vite 7（2026-10 已升到 Vite 8）+ Vitest + oxlint</td>\n<td>构建、测试、代码质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个组合的核心思路是用 Convex 同时承担数据库和后端逻辑，省掉独立的 API 服务器和 ORM 层。前端选 TanStack Start 而非 Next.js，与 Convex 的实时订阅模型配合更自然。</p>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"1073\" style=\"--img-ar:1.4911\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture_6f4c83244bd6.webp\" alt=\"Convex 作为 ClawHub 数据中枢的示意图，展示 queries/mutations/actions 三种函数类型如何与前端和外部服务交互\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"数据模型：Skill-的生命周期\"><a href=\"#数据模型：Skill-的生命周期\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"数据模型：Skill 的生命周期\"></a>数据模型：Skill 的生命周期</h2><p>ClawHub 的 Convex schema 定义了几个核心表。<code>skills</code> 表的结构揭示了一个 skill 从发布到展示的完整生命周期：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// convex/schema.ts（核心字段，省略部分）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> skills <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">defineTable</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  slug<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>                    <span class=\"token comment\">// URL 友好的唯一标识</span>\n  displayName<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>             <span class=\"token comment\">// 显示名称</span>\n  summary<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>     <span class=\"token comment\">// 一句话描述</span>\n  ownerUserId<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'users'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>          <span class=\"token comment\">// 作者</span>\n  latestVersionId<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'skillVersions'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  tags<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">record</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'skillVersions'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// latest, v1.0.0 等</span>\n  badges<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> badgesValidator<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>             <span class=\"token comment\">// 官方认证、高亮、弃用标记</span>\n  moderationVerdict<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>       <span class=\"token comment\">// 安全审查结论</span>\n    v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">union</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'clean'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'suspicious'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'malicious'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  moderationEvidence<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">array</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">object</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    code<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    severity<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">union</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'info'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'warn'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'critical'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    file<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    line<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    message<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    evidence<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  quality<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">optional</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">object</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>       <span class=\"token comment\">// 质量评分</span>\n    score<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">number</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    decision<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">union</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'pass'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'quarantine'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'reject'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    trustTier<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">union</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'low'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'medium'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">literal</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'trusted'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\">// ...</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  stats<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> statsValidator<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>               <span class=\"token comment\">// 下载数、star 数、评论数</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>几个设计要点：</p>\n<p><strong>标签即版本指针</strong>。<code>tags</code> 字段是一个 <code>Record&lt;string, Id&lt;'skillVersions'&gt;&gt;</code>，<code>latest</code> 指向最新稳定版，语义版本号指向具体版本。这比维护独立的 latest 字段更灵活——你可以有 <code>beta</code>、<code>canary</code> 等任意标签。</p>\n<p><strong>审查结论内嵌到 skill 记录</strong>。moderation 相关字段直接放在 <code>skills</code> 表上，没有拆独立表。这样查询 skill 列表时不需要 JOIN，Convex 的单表查询性能直接受益。</p>\n<p><strong>软删除 + 预留 slug</strong>。删除 skill 时只设置 <code>softDeletedAt</code>，不做物理删除。同时有一套 slug 预留机制（90 天冷却期），防止有人抢注被删除的知名 skill 名称。</p>\n<h2 id=\"搜索：向量分数加上词法和下载量修正\"><a href=\"#搜索：向量分数加上词法和下载量修正\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"搜索：向量分数加上词法和下载量修正\"></a>搜索：向量分数加上词法和下载量修正</h2><p>ClawHub 的搜索是这个项目最有技术含量的部分之一。它组合了向量相似度、词法匹配和流行度三个信号：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// convex/search.ts（评分逻辑）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">SLUG_EXACT_BOOST</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.4</span>      <span class=\"token comment\">// slug 精确匹配加分</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">SLUG_PREFIX_BOOST</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.8</span>     <span class=\"token comment\">// slug 前缀匹配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">NAME_EXACT_BOOST</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.1</span>      <span class=\"token comment\">// 名称精确匹配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">NAME_PREFIX_BOOST</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.6</span>     <span class=\"token comment\">// 名称前缀匹配</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">POPULARITY_WEIGHT</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.08</span>    <span class=\"token comment\">// 流行度权重</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">scoreSkillResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>queryTokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> vectorScore<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> displayName<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> slug<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> downloads<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> lexicalBoost <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">getLexicalBoost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>queryTokens<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> displayName<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> slug<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> popularityBoost <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log1p</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>Math<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>downloads<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> <span class=\"token constant\">POPULARITY_WEIGHT</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> vectorScore <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> lexicalBoost <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> popularityBoost\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>搜索流程分三步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>生成 embedding：用 OpenAI <code>text-embedding-3-small</code>（1536 维）对查询文本做嵌入，调用 Convex 的向量索引获取候选集</li>\n<li>词法加权：对候选结果做 slug 和名称的 token 匹配，精确匹配加 1.4 分，前缀匹配加 0.6-0.8 分</li>\n<li>流行度加成：用 <code>log1p(downloads)</code> 做对数平滑，避免下载量大的 skill 过度霸榜</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这种混合排序策略解决了纯向量搜索的常见问题：用户搜「padel」时，名字就叫 <code>padel</code> 的 skill 应该排第一，而不是语义相似但名字不同的结果。</p>\n<p>2026-10 的主干上，这段逻辑又调整过：slug 与查询完全一致时的加分提高到 <code>EXACT_SLUG_BOOST = 2.5</code>，原来的 1.4 变成了”slug 的每个 token 都精确匹配”时的 <code>SLUG_TOKEN_BOOST</code>；<code>scoreSkillResult</code> 里的下载量加成被去掉了，排序另外引入了按匹配程度分档（<code>rankTier</code>）的机制。</p>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"1073\" style=\"--img-ar:1.4911\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture_5a30049442f6.webp\" alt=\"ClawHub 混合搜索流程图：用户查询 → OpenAI Embedding → Convex 向量索引 → 词法加权 → 流行度修正 → 排序结果\"></p>\n<p>嵌入生成模块本身也做了工程化处理：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// convex/lib/embeddings.ts</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">EMBEDDING_MODEL</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">'text-embedding-3-small'</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1536</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">MAX_ATTEMPTS</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">BASE_RETRY_DELAY_MS</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1_000</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 无 API Key 时降级为零向量，搜索功能不会完全不可用</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">!</span>apiKey<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token builtin\">console</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">warn</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'OPENAI_API_KEY is not configured; using zero embeddings'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token function\">emptyEmbedding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// Array(1536).fill(0)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>没有 OpenAI API Key 时，搜索降级为纯词法匹配，不会崩溃。本地开发不配 Key 也能跑，下文实测时就是这样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全审查引擎\"><a href=\"#安全审查引擎\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"安全审查引擎\"></a>安全审查引擎</h2><p>作为一个接受社区上传 skill 的平台，安全是 ClawHub 的核心关注点。它内置了一个静态安全扫描引擎，在 skill 发布时自动运行：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// convex/lib/moderationEngine.ts</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">scanCodeFile</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>path<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> findings<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 检测 child_process 调用</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token regex\"><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-source language-regex\">child_process</span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> execPattern<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">addFinding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>findings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      code<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token constant\">REASON_CODES</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">DANGEROUS_EXEC</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      severity<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'critical'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      file<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> path<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      line<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> match<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>line<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      message<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Shell command execution detected (child_process).'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      evidence<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> match<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>text<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 检测 eval/new Function</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token regex\"><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span><span class=\"token regex-source language-regex\">\\beval\\s*\\(|new\\s+Function\\s*\\(</span><span class=\"token regex-delimiter\">/</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">test</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">addFinding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>findings<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      code<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token constant\">REASON_CODES</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">DYNAMIC_CODE</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      severity<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'critical'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token comment\">// ...</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>审查引擎扫描的内容包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>代码文件（.js/.ts/.py/.sh 等）：检查 <code>child_process</code>、<code>eval</code>、<code>new Function</code> 等危险调用</li>\n<li>非标准端口的网络请求</li>\n<li>Manifest 文件（JSON/YAML）中的可疑配置</li>\n<li>Markdown 文件中的隐藏指令</li>\n</ul>\n<p>扫描结果产生三级 verdict：<code>clean</code>（安全）、<code>suspicious</code>（可疑）、<code>malicious</code>（恶意）。注意上面代码里的 <code>severity: 'critical'</code> 并不决定 verdict：verdict 由 reason code 的前缀决定（<code>verdictFromCodes</code>），<code>child_process</code> 和 <code>eval</code> 的 code 是 <code>suspicious.*</code>，所以静态扫描命中它们也只判 suspicious。<code>b32a499</code> 的静态规则里只有挖矿特征（<code>stratum+tcp</code>、<code>xmrig</code> 等）和一条已知恶意签名会产生 <code>malicious.*</code>；其余的 malicious 来自外部扫描（VirusTotal、LLM 审查结果被写成 <code>malicious.vt_malicious</code> 一类的 code）或人工标记，<code>moderationEngine.ts:367-370</code> 的 <code>resolveSkillVerdict</code> 就是按这些 code 和标记回推最终判定的。可疑和恶意的 skill 会被标记或隐藏，管理员可以通过 <code>manualOverride</code> 字段手动覆盖自动判定（2026-10 的 schema 里这个字段已标为弃用、等待迁移移除）。</p>\n<p>此外，ClawHub 还接入了 VirusTotal API 做恶意文件扫描（未配置 Key 时跳过），并把 VirusTotal 和 LLM 审查这两个外部扫描器的结论合入最终判定；另有一个质量评分系统，自动隔离过短、模板化的低质量提交。</p>\n<p>这套机制的背景是 2026 年 2 月 Koi Security 在 ClawHub 上发现的 341 个恶意 Skill（代号 ClawHavoc，原始报告见 <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20260210212946/https://www.koi.ai/blog/clawhavoc-341-malicious-clawedbot-skills-found-by-the-bot-they-were-targeting\">Koi Security 博客的存档</a>（原地址现已跳转到 Palo Alto Networks 页面），转述见 <a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/02/researchers-find-341-malicious-clawhub.html\">The Hacker News</a>；我的整理见 <a href=\"/2026/03/05/openclaw-tips-essential-skills/\">OpenClaw 进阶实战第 7 条</a>），它们主要靠 SKILL.md 里诱导用户执行安装脚本，而不是靠代码文件本身。</p>\n<p>我很好奇 <code>b32a499</code> 的静态扫描能不能拦住这种写法，于是直接调用 <code>runStaticModerationScan</code> 喂了 4 个构造的输入（2026-10-30，Bun 1.4.3）：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-text\" data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\">A: SKILL.md 里要求 curl | bash            =&gt; clean []\nB: SKILL.md 里要求下载并执行二进制        =&gt; clean []\nC: index.js 用 child_process.exec          =&gt; suspicious [\"suspicious.dangerous_exec\"]\nD: 普通 SKILL.md                           =&gt; clean []</code></pre>\n\n<p>ClawHavoc 式的两种写法（A、B）都是 <code>clean</code>。原因在 <code>scanMarkdownFile</code>：这个版本对 Markdown 只匹配 <code>ignore previous instructions</code>、<code>system prompt:</code> 这类提示注入短语，不看安装命令。也就是说，对这类攻击，静态正则基本不起作用，靠的是 VirusTotal 和 LLM 审查这两道外部扫描，本地不配 Key 时它们都会跳过。2026-10-29 的主干（<code>907b6398</code>）里多了一个 <code>hasMaliciousInstallPrompt</code>，会检查 <code>curl ... | sh</code>，但要同时出现”复制到终端”一类的引导语，并且带直连 IP 或安装包特征才算命中，条件收得比较紧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"CLI-发布流程\"><a href=\"#CLI-发布流程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"CLI 发布流程\"></a>CLI 发布流程</h2><p>开发者通过 <code>clawhub</code> CLI 与注册中心交互。发布一个 skill 的完整流程如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 1. 登录</span>\nclawhub login\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 准备 skill 目录</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">mkdir</span> my-skill <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">cd</span> my-skill\n<span class=\"token function\">cat</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> SKILL.md <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"token string\">'EOF'\n---\nname: my-skill\ndescription: A useful skill for data analysis\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    requires:\n      env:\n        - MY_API_KEY\n      bins:\n        - python3\n    primaryEnv: MY_API_KEY\n---\n\n## Usage\n...\nEOF</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 3. 发布</span>\nclawhub publish <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">.</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--slug</span> my-skill <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--name</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"My Skill\"</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--version</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span>.0\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 4. 验证</span>\nclawhub search <span class=\"token string\">\"my-skill\"</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>CLI 的 publish 命令在底层做了这些事：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-typescript\" data-language=\"typescript\"><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"token comment\">// packages/clawdhub/src/cli/commands/publish.ts（简化；2026-10 该目录已改名为 packages/clawhub）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> filesOnDisk <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">listTextFiles</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>folder<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 强制要求 SKILL.md（也接受 skills.md）存在</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">!</span>filesOnDisk<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">some</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>f <span class=\"token operator\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'skill.md'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">'skills.md'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">includes</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>f<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>relPath<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toLowerCase</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token function\">fail</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'SKILL.md required'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// 元数据放在 payload 字段，文件统一追加到 files 字段</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> form <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">FormData</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nform<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'payload'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token constant\">JSON</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">stringify</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> slug<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> displayName<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> version<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> changelog<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> acceptLicenseTerms<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tags <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> file <span class=\"token keyword\">of</span> filesOnDisk<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> blob <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Blob</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>Buffer<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">from</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>bytes<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> type<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>contentType <span class=\"token operator\">??</span> <span class=\"token string\">'text/plain'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  form<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">append</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'files'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> blob<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> file<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>relPath<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">// POST 到注册中心的 skills 接口（由 Convex HTTP Action 处理）</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">apiRequestForm</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>registry<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> method<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'POST'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> path<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> ApiRoutes<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>skills<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> token<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> form <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ApiV1PublishResponseSchema<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>服务端收到后依次处理：文件存储 → 版本记录创建 → embedding 生成 → 安全扫描 → 全局统计更新。Convex 里只有 mutation 是事务性的，action 可以调外部服务（OpenAI、VirusTotal）但本身不具备回滚能力，所以这条流水线是”在 action 里编排、把每一步的数据库写入放进各自的 mutation”，而不是一个整体事务。</p>\n<p><img width=\"1600\" height=\"1073\" style=\"--img-ar:1.4911\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/clawhub-skill-registry-architecture_70da138aaf49.webp\" alt=\"ClawHub Skill 发布流程：CLI publish → FormData 上传 → Convex HTTP Action → 文件存储/版本创建/Embedding 生成/安全扫描 四个并行步骤\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"在本机把-b32a499-跑起来\"><a href=\"#在本机把-b32a499-跑起来\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"在本机把 b32a499 跑起来\"></a>在本机把 b32a499 跑起来</h2><p>README 的 Local dev 只有几行命令，真正能跑通要看同一个提交里的 CONTRIBUTING.md。我在 2026-10-30 按 CONTRIBUTING.md 把 <code>b32a499</code> 跑了一遍（Ubuntu 26.04、Bun 1.4.3、Node 22.22.0，不登录 Convex、不配 GitHub OAuth、不配任何 API Key），过程如下。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">git</span> clone https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub.git <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">cd</span> clawhub\n<span class=\"token function\">git</span> checkout b32a499\nbun <span class=\"token function\">install</span>                      <span class=\"token comment\"># 527 packages installed [377.24s]，preinstall 先跑了 bunx only-allow bun</span>\n<span class=\"token function\">cp</span> .env.local.example .env.local</code></pre>\n\n<p>CONTRIBUTING.md 要求在 <code>.env.local</code> 里写 <code>VITE_CONVEX_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3210</code> 和 <code>CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT=anonymous:anonymous-clawhub</code>，然后 <code>bunx convex dev --typecheck=disable</code> 启动本地后端。这里碰到了第一个和文档不一致的地方：我机器上 3210 端口已经被别的服务占了，Convex CLI 自动把后端挪到了 3211（HTTP Actions 在 3212），但它不会改 <code>.env.local</code>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-text\" data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\">Downloading Convex backend binary\nDownloading Convex dashboard\nCan't safely modify .env.local for VITE_CONVEX_URL, please edit manually.\nFound multiple VITE_CONVEX_SITE_URL environment variables in .env.local so cannot update automatically.\n✔ Started running a deployment locally at http://127.0.0.1:3211 and saved its name as CONVEX_DEPLOYMENT to .env.local\n...\n✔ 16:14:08 Convex functions ready! (4.5s)\n[vt:pollPendingScans] VT_API_KEY not configured, skipping</code></pre>\n\n<p>所以 <code>VITE_CONVEX_URL</code> 要手动改成 CLI 实际给出的端口，实际端口可以在 <code>~/.convex/anonymous-convex-backend-state/&lt;部署名&gt;/config.json</code> 的 <code>ports</code> 里查到。日志最后一行也印证了前面说的降级：没有 VirusTotal Key，扫描任务直接跳过，不报错。这个提交锁定的 Convex CLI 是 1.31.7，启动时提示有 1.48.0 可升。</p>\n<p>接着按文档填充示例数据，三条 skill（padel、gohome、xuezh）都写进去了，每条都带一个 <code>embeddingId</code>（没有 OpenAI Key，存的是零向量）：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">bunx convex run --no-push devSeed:seedNixSkills\n<span class=\"token comment\"># {\"ok\": true, \"slug\": \"padel\", \"skillId\": \"nn72...\", \"versionId\": \"nh73...\", \"embeddingId\": \"md71...\"} x 3</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>前端 <code>bun run dev</code> 用 Vite 7.3.1 起在 3000 端口，751 ms 就绪；首页 SSR 只返回一个 2.7 KB 的外壳，列表由浏览器端订阅 Convex 后渲染。我没有配 GitHub OAuth，登录、发布、评论这些需要账号的功能没有测，直接 POST <code>/api/v1/skills</code> 返回 401。</p>\n<p>用仓库里的 CLI 指向本地后端搜索，正好可以验证上文的打分公式（零向量时 <code>vectorScore</code> 为 0，示例数据下载量都是 0，流行度加成也是 0）：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-text\" data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\">$ CLAWHUB_REGISTRY=http://127.0.0.1:3212 bun packages/clawdhub/src/cli.ts search padel\npadel  Padel  (2.500)      # slug 精确 1.4 + 名称精确 1.1\n$ ... search go\ngohome  GoHome  (1.400)    # slug 前缀 0.8 + 名称前缀 0.6\n$ ... search pad\npadel  Padel  (1.400)\n$ ... search \"home automation\"\n（无结果）</code></pre>\n\n<p><code>search go</code> 能命中 <code>gohome</code>，<code>search \"home automation\"</code> 却什么都没有：词法匹配按 token 做前缀比较，<code>home</code> 不是 <code>gohome</code> 的前缀，而零向量又提供不了任何语义相似度。也就是说，不配 OpenAI Key 时搜索确实不会崩，但只剩 slug 和名称的前缀匹配，研究排序逻辑够用，体验不了语义搜索。同一个结果走 HTTP API 也能看到，<code>tags</code> 在 API 层已经被解析成版本号：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-text\" data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\">$ curl -s \"http://127.0.0.1:3212/api/v1/search?q=padel\"\n{\"results\":[{\"score\":2.5,\"slug\":\"padel\",\"displayName\":\"Padel\",\"summary\":\"Check padel court availability and manage bookings via Playtomic.\",\"version\":null,...}]}\n$ curl -s \"http://127.0.0.1:3212/api/v1/skills?limit=5\"\nxuezh  Xuezh  tags={'latest': '0.1.0'}  stats={'downloads': 0, 'stars': 0, 'versions': 1, ...}</code></pre>\n\n<p>仓库自带的单元测试也能离线跑：<code>bunx vitest run convex/search.test.ts convex/lib/moderationEngine.test.ts</code>，15 + 12 个用例全部通过，耗时 351 ms。</p>\n<p>CONTRIBUTING.md 里还有 <code>bunx convex env set AUTH_GITHUB_ID ...</code> 和 <code>bunx @convex-dev/auth</code> 生成 JWT 密钥两步，需要先在 GitHub 建 OAuth App，我没有做。另外注意本地 Convex 后端监听的是 <code>0.0.0.0</code>，在共享网络里跑完记得关掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"架构决策复盘\"><a href=\"#架构决策复盘\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"架构决策复盘\"></a>架构决策复盘</h2><p>ClawHub 的技术选型有几个值得关注的取舍：</p>\n<p><strong>选 Convex 不选 PostgreSQL + Express</strong>：Convex 把数据库、实时订阅、Serverless 函数、文件存储打包在一起，省掉了大量胶水代码。代价是强绑定 Convex 平台，迁移成本高。对于一个快速迭代的社区项目，这个取舍合理。</p>\n<p><strong>选 TanStack Start 不选 Next.js</strong>：TanStack Start 基于 Vite，与 Convex 的 React hooks 集成顺畅。写作时 TanStack Start 还在快速演进，选它需要承受 API 变动的风险。</p>\n<p><strong>选 Bun 不选 Node.js</strong>：package.json 里有 <code>\"preinstall\": \"bunx only-allow bun\"</code>，强制使用 Bun。Bun 的安装速度和 TypeScript 原生支持是主要动力。</p>\n<p><strong>安全扫描用正则不用 AST</strong>：ModerationEngine 用正则匹配危险模式，而非解析 AST。正则覆盖不了所有绕过手段，但对于文本为主的 skill bundle（大部分是 Markdown + 少量脚本），足够高效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考资料\"><a href=\"#参考资料\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"参考资料\"></a>参考资料</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub\">ClawHub GitHub 仓库</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://clawhub.ai/\">ClawHub 官网</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.convex.dev/\">Convex 官方文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://tanstack.com/start/latest\">TanStack Start 文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/embeddings\">OpenAI Embeddings API 文档</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub/blob/main/VISION.md\">OpenClaw 项目 VISION.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
